cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use jepa-studio, please cite it as below, and cite LeJEPA (and LeWorldModel if you use the world model)."
title: "jepa-studio: pretrain, inspect and use LeJEPA models on your own unlabeled data"
abstract: >-
  An app and Python package to pretrain LeJEPA (JEPA + SIGReg) models on unlabeled images,
  video or time series, inspect and evaluate their embeddings, and plan with a CEM planner
  inside a learned latent world model, in the browser or on the desktop.
type: software
authors:
